==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Othom]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 160~163.33 seconds<sup>4,800f~4,900f</sup>.
*2 [[Bun Bun Black]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 190~193.33 seconds<sup>5,700f~5,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kappy Kawano]] spawns as the boss after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**3 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 2~5.33 seconds<sup>60f~160f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you'd like to fight this stage normally, you should use lots of [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]], but remember to reserve counters for the Bun Bun Blacks and Othoms, as well as the remaining peons.

Because Kappy Kawano takes over 100 seconds to spawn and the starting threats aren't too difficult, it's possible to beat the stage before he spawns by quickly killing Othom and then use brute force to make sure Bun Bun Black can't get any further while your DPS units reduce the enemy base to rubble.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: Courier's Long Distance attacks and massive damage to [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] can decimate J.J. Jackrabbit and Ginger Snache, both of which spawn frequently and can be very threatening if left unchecked. Courier's high speed also makes it easier to time and allows it to catch up with the frontline sooner.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: A Can Can with the Extra Money, Move Speed Up, Defense Buff and Attack Buff [[Talents]] is useful for dealing with Ginger Snache, but most importantly Heavenly Hippoe due to its high stats, while also getting some additional resources to work with.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]: The essence of any rush strategy, Fishman's massive damage to [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] makes it extremely useful against Bun Bun Black and Othom, though it should not have the Move Speed Up Talent so it can exploit Othom's short curse duration.
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]: A tanky unit that works well with "Research" Effect UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]], Ramen's resistance to [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] makes him particularly suited to fighting Heavenly Hippoe. He also comes into use against other enemies, as a sufficiently boosted Ramen can absorb one hit and his singular knockback means he can stall the others pretty consistently.
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]]: Boulder works very much like Ramen with its extreme durability, and with Research Combos can form a thick layer of defense.
*[[Killer Cat (Rare Cat)|Radical Cat]]: Radical Cat's kit is practically tailored towards this stage, as he is strong against Bun Bun Black and Othom (the hit that inflicts Curse is still affected by Strong normally, and it lacks full uptime due to Othom's very short Curse duration), while also being Surge-immune. As a nice bonus, he can also survive one hit from Kawano at only level 30. The only problem he really has is his recharge time, which can partially be alleviated using his Combo [[Bad Guys (Combo)|Bad Guys]].

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]]: Yukimura's very high speed, good stats, low cost and massive damage to [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] makes him a great pick. If you have an opening after getting rid of Othom, he can deal heavy damage to Bun Bun Black and make things easier for other units.
*[[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]]/[[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]: with either of these abilities are quite likely to be helpful in killing Kappy Kawano, potentially even while the Bun Bun Blacks are still alive. [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli, Daughter of Chaos]] and [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]] in particular work well against Kappy, but make sure to account for them triggering Kappy's [[Counter-Surge]].
*[[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Windy]]: Windy's great range and absurd damage against floating enemies makes her a great choice to send both the Bun Bun Black and the Othom to the shadow realm. She works if you are trying to accomplish the rush strategy, but do be mindful of her cost.

==Trivia==
*"Ghost" is a translation of 妖怪 ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'', a class of supernatural creatures and phenomena in Japanese folklore. The ''[[wikipedia:Kappa (folklore)|kappa]]'' is an example of a ''yōkai''.

